        "content": {
          "body": "Proposal: keep graph traversal in Postgres via Apache AGE instead of running a separate Memgraph instance per tenant. Single-hop Cypher covers our query model and saves ops cost.",
          "explicitLinks": []
        },
        "raw": {}
      },
      {
